# This file ensures the static directory is tracked by git
# In a real deployment, this directory would contain:
# - disease/ subdirectory with disease images
# - sample_images/ subdirectory with test plant leaf images
# - css/ subdirectory with custom stylesheets
# - js/ subdirectory with JavaScript files

# Disease image naming convention:
# static/diseases/{disease_name}_{view}_{index}.jpg
# Examples:
# - static/diseases/leaf_rust_symptom_1.jpg
# - static/diseases/powdery_mildew_leaf_close.jpg
# - static/diseases/bacterial_spot_tomato_1.jpg